#: ui/MainWindow.glade:717
msgid "Tailored to Your Needs, Made for You! Pardus Was Created for You"
msgstr "İhtiyacınıza Uygun, Size Özel! Pardus Sizin İçin Yapıldı"

#: ui/MainWindow.glade:790
